    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39250" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prŭīnōsus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj.
		pruina. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Full of hoar-frost</i>, <i>frosty</i>, <i>rimy</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">herbae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					4, 82</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nox,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Am. 2, 19, 22</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">axis (Aurorae),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					ib. 1, 6, 65</span></i>
			; 1, 13, 2: equi Noctis,
			<i><span class="en">id. P. 1,
				2, 56</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">caeli status,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					4, 23, 2</span></i>
			. —* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>: panni, <i>cold</i>,
			i. e. <i>affording no warmth</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Petr. 83 <i>fin.</i></span></i></div>
